        "char_hua_an"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eastern Sea saying places Hua An as hiding in Nan Gong among the three most capable wisdom path Gu Immortals, beside Song Jia Dan at twin polar and Dragon Head Tortoise in adversity sea.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_song_jia_dan",
        "char_dragon_head_tortoise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nan Gong clan is a righteous path super force of Eastern Sea. You Chan seeks help there and is welcomed by a respectful rank six Nan Gong clan Gu Immortal sent by Master Hua. Hua An was originally of Hua clan, left under pressure, obtained You Chan’s help, and was taken in by Nan Gong clan, where he cultivated until he was reputed for wisdom path. He usually stays inside Nan Gong clan headquarters and rarely goes out because Hua clan still threatens him.",
      "chapters": [
        1472
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hua-ans-refuge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hua_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Yue Zhi Cheng flies toward Nan Gong clan territory to ask Hua An’s help. Midway he meets a rank six Gu Immortal of Nan Gong clan who brings Hua An’s message that Hua An already deduced the visit and waits ahead.",
      "chapters": [
        1495
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
